title: Barracuda CloudGen Firewall: Service Status
agents: snmp
catalog: app/barracuda
license: GPLv2
distribution: phion
description:
 This check monitors the status of the individual server services running
 on a Barracuda CloudGen Firewall, as reported by the Phion-MIB. The
 service is {OK} while up, and {CRIT} otherwise ({down}, {block}, {wild}
 or {removed}).

item:
 The name of the service as reported by the device.

discovery:
 One service is created for each service reported by the device.
